---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="GCSE Revision Timetable | Free 8-Week Study Plan"
  description="Complete GCSE revision timetable with 8-week study plan. Free download for GCSE students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>GCSE Revision<br><span>Timetable</span></h1>
    <p>8-week study plan. Organize your revision for maximum effectiveness.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>8-Week Plan</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Week 1-2: Foundation</h3>
        <pre><code>• Review all subject outlines
• Identify weak areas
• Create topic lists
• Gather revision materials
• Set up study space</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Week 3-4: Core Content</h3>
        <pre><code>• Focus on high-yield topics
• Active recall practice
• Create flashcards
• Practice past papers
• Review mistakes</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Week 5-6: Application</h3>
        <pre><code>• Practice exam questions
• Timed conditions
• Analyze mark schemes
• Identify patterns
• Refine techniques</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Week 7-8: Final Review</h3>
        <pre><code>• Full past papers
• Focus on weak areas only
• Quick-fire revision
• Rest before exams
• Confidence building</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Daily Schedule</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Sample Day</h3>
        <pre><code>9:00 - 10:30: Subject 1 (active recall)
10:30 - 10:45: Break
10:45 - 12:15: Subject 2 (past papers)
12:15 - 1:15: Lunch
1:15 - 2:45: Subject 3 (flashcards)
2:45 - 3:00: Break
3:00 - 4:30: Subject 4 (practice questions)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Study Techniques</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Active Recall</h3>
        <pre><code>• Test yourself regularly
• Cover and recall information
• Use flashcards
• Teach someone else
• Practice retrieval</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Spaced Repetition</h3>
        <pre><code>• Review at increasing intervals
• Day 1 → Day 3 → Day 7 → Day 14
• Use spaced repetition software
• Focus on weak areas
• Regular short sessions</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
